            "Thank you for visiting Vegbooks! We accept review copies of children’s books (print and ebook) and movies (DVD, Blu-ray, and digital download) that deal with the following subjects: animals, the environment, and healthy eating. We are also interested in children’s books and movies that encourage children to stand up for themselves or others. ",
